Keep a shared redqueue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared bluequeue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared redstart as 0.
Keep a shared redend as 0.
Keep a shared bluestart as 0.
Keep a shared blueend as 0.
Keep a shared size as 0.
Keep a shared redpick as 0.
Keep a shared bluepick as 0.
The reds is a list of 20 zeros.
The blues is a list of 20 zeros.
Set redqueue to reds.
Set bluequeue to blues.
To brighten from pick (a whole number).
The endspot is redend.
Set item endspot of redqueue to pick plus size.
Add 1 to redend.
Add 1 to redstart.
Add 1 to bluestart.

To darken from pick (a whole number).
The endspot is blueend.
Set item endspot of bluequeue to pick plus size.
Add 1 to blueend.
Add 1 to redstart.
Add 1 to bluestart.

The source is "RD".
Set size to the number of characters in source.
For every seat from 0 to size minus 1.
The symbol is character seat of source.
The redslot is redend.
The blueslot is blueend.
If symbol is "R", set item redslot of redqueue to seat, add 1 to redend.
If symbol is "D", set item blueslot of bluequeue to seat, add 1 to blueend.

Repeat while redstart is less than redend and bluestart is less than blueend.
The redslot is redstart.
The blueslot is bluestart.
Set redpick to item redslot of redqueue.
Set bluepick to item blueslot of bluequeue.
If redpick is less than bluepick, brighten from redpick, otherwise darken from bluepick.

If redstart is less than redend, show "Radiant".
If bluestart is less than blueend, show "Dire".
